l mobs to complete quests, and quests that require to kill Ants (Ant Challenge)\n* Use Red/Blue Extract/Glitter/Glue/Oil/Cloud Vial/Jelly Beans/Tropical Drink for Legendary/Mythic Puffshroom\n* Use Oil/Stingers when killing Mondo Chick, Coconut Crab\n* Support auto load of multiple accounts (coming soon)\n* Support for anti-disconnects, auto rejoin (coming soon)\n* Support for script settings per account upon game join (coming soon)\n* Support for more NPCs to the auto quests (to do)\n* Auto re-plant planters on different fields for their color (to do)\n* Add auto kill Commando Chick (to do)\n* Select types (rare,epic etc) to auto farm sprouts (to do)","tags":["roblox","bee swarm","kocmoc","chocmoc","op"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62c82b79c6f372c6041110d6","username":"long_ttran","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"62c82b79c6f372c6041110d6","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T03:22:36.450Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4e899","editBy":{"_id":"62c82b79c6f372c6041110d6","username":"long_ttran","status":"offline","id":"62c82b79c6f372c6041110d6"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:06:54.901Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"62c83511ffcb2894bee1667e","commentBy":{"_id":"62c448165c6b74312ccff904","username":"jeremybiellc","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2022-07-05T14:17:58.953Z","lastActive":"2022-10-17T21:42:16.741Z","status":"offline","id":"62c448165c6b74312ccff904","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.